WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
Reseller administrators begin in the customer directory.

2
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:08.909
Open a customer workspace to enter that tenant’s permitted scope, then choose Customer Fleet.

3
00:00:08.909 --> 00:00:15.697
Delegated fleet management lets you add a vehicle and choose how it appears on the map.

4
00:00:15.697 --> 00:00:22.060
Notice that location access is still separate: the customer continues to control every location grant.
